ra.fi","c":9},{"lap":42,"text":"On lap 42 Masetti stopped the Mercedes at the pits as his mechanic had become unconscious and unknowingly had thereby broken the fuel line.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":9},{"lap":43,"text":"Masetti retires after Lesmo.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":43,"text":"On lap 43 Zbowowski stopped at the pits to change rear wheels and spark plugs.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":43,"text":"Masetti retires after Lesmo.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":43,"text":"On lap 43 Zbowowski stopped at the pits to change rear wheels and spark plugs.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":44,"text":"Zborowski crashes at the Lesmo North Turn; the car hits a post and ends against a tree.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":44,"text":"He died during transport to the hospital.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":44,"text":"Zborowski crashes at the Lesmo North Turn; the car hits a post and ends against a tree.","q":false,"c":10},{"lap":44,"text":"He died during transport to the hospital.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":51,"text":"On lap 51 Merz for Neubauer stopped at the pits with a flat left front tire and gave the car back to Neubauer.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":51,"text":"On lap 51 Merz for Neubauer stopped at the pits with a flat left front tire and gave the car back to Neubauer.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":60,"text":"On lap 60 Presenti stopped to top up fuel and gave the car back to Campari, while Wagner had passed Campari who was now in fourth place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":60,"text":"Presenti hands the car over to Campari.","c":2},{"lap":60,"text":"On lap 60 Presenti stopped to top up fuel and gave the car back to Campari, while Wagner had passed Campari who was now in fourth place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":60,"text":"Presenti hands the car over to Campari.","c":2},{"lap":62,"text":"On lap 62 Werner stopped to top up with fuel and oil and was relieved 